@startuml
[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state WaitingForPIN
state ValidatingPIN
state WaitingForCustomerChoice
state Confiscating
state Ejecting
state Terminating

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted
WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN --> try again
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Invalid PIN too many times
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Card Invalid
WaitingForPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel
ValidatingPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel
WaitingForCustomerChoice --> Ejecting : Cancel
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForCustomerChoice : Valid PIN
@enduml
